{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Delirium: Echoes of the Domino is a hypnotic, twisting domino roguelike where every tile can unleash chaos. Combine pieces, activate supernatural powers and face digital deities in games that change each time you play. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build strategic plays, discover rule-breaking wild cards, and survive conditions that alter the rules of the board. Bet, risk and look for impossible combos as you enter a retrofuturistic world where nothing is as it seems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master the boards, avoid traps, and face unique bosses who will change the rules at will. Each game brings you one step closer to breaking the cycle\u2026 or being trapped forever.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3707610?t=1749541211","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707610/9ab9dde9f3c734efb7e58aaeec3ad276517b17a0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749541211","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707610/6fcb1a73fd38b6e85e2cc619d40a0d9e469bdecc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749541211","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707610/6fcb1a73fd38b6e85e2cc619d40a0d9e469bdecc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749541211","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Delirium: Echoes of the Domino is a hypnotic, twisting domino roguelike where every tile can unleash chaos. Combine pieces, activate supernatural powers and face digital deities in games that change each time you play. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build strategic plays, discover rule-breaking wild cards, and survive conditions that alte